<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX closes down as Komecni slides.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX closes down as Komecni slides.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - The Czech RPIX closes down on Monday led by the bourse's most heavily capitalised banking share, Komercni Banka.</p>
<p>*  .RPIX drops 8.5 points, 0.82 percent, to 1,024.0.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 32.2 million crowns.</p>
<p>* Komercni falls 50 crowns to 1,590.</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom drops 20 crowns to 3,605.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
